  "text": "Fódla was one of the three chief goddesses of the land of Ireland. The other two were Banba and Ériu. Eadán cut Fódla down in combat. Her people did not all fall with her. Many of them moved into an Otherworld. From that place they kept their unseen hold on the land they had left behind.",
